# Scrollbar

The items-page bag bar is the default for any new scroller. Copy `.bpb-bg` in `js/shared/backpack-grid/backpack-grid.css`. Do not invent a gray, OS, or pill scrollbar.

## Recipe

Colors on the scroller:

- `--bpb-bg-scroll-thumb: #eac914`
- `--bpb-bg-scroll-track: #816230`
- `--bpb-bg-scroll-frame: #472a24`

Standard properties stay automatic. WebKit draws the bar:

- `scrollbar-width: auto`
- `scrollbar-color: auto`
- `::-webkit-scrollbar` — 16px wide and tall
- track — 3px solid frame, 16px radius, track fill
- thumb — 2px solid frame, 20px radius, thumb fill
- No `::-webkit-scrollbar-button` rules

## Do not

Set `scrollbar-color` to the gold/brown pair. On Windows that keeps the classic arrows and paints them yellow.

Filter rails that already use the thinner square bar (`.items-filters` in `js/pages/items/catalog.css`, 10px, square thumb) stay on that bar. Do not add a third style.
